  "annotations": [
    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Keeping a hand with 4 Islands and 0 red sources in a UR deck. While the hand can cast its colorless artifacts and Perilous Voyage, it has no red mana to cast red creatures like Tectonic Giant, Onakke Ogre, or Dragon Hatchling. The hand lacks early pressure and relies on drawing red sources naturally.",
      "action_taken": "Kept the 7-card hand with no red mana sources",
      "better_line": "Mulligan to 6 looking for a hand with both colors of mana. A 6-card hand with at least one red source and reasonable spells would likely perform better than a 7-card hand missing an entire color.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 2,
      "player": "GPT5 Spike",
      "decision_index": 1,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "With 3 Islands already in hand and only 3-mana spells to cast, GPT5 Spike kept one Island on top during scry instead of bottoming both. They already have enough lands to cast all their spells (Bloodline Pretender, Heirloom Blade at 3 mana, Faerie Seer at 1), so drawing another Island is low value compared to finding action/threats.",
      "action_taken": "Bottomed only one Island, keeping the other on top of library",
      "better_line": "Bottom both Islands to dig toward spells, since hand already has 3 Islands which is sufficient to cast everything available",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 64,
      "player": "GPT5 Spike",
      "decision_index": 22,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
